# Generated panels — ~350 MB for three instruments, rebuildable in ~90s from the
# M1 cache with `python vumanchuLab/panel.py`. Not artifacts to version.
data/
__pycache__/

# ...EXCEPT the frozen state table. That one is SHIPPED, not generated at run
# time: server.js reads it to answer /api/vumanchu/state, so if it is not in the
# repo Railway boots with no table and every live read returns "table not built".
# This is the learn-offline / ship-a-file contract (PYTHON_LEGO.md §3) — the
# brain is measured in Python and the live side only ever reads the artifact.
!data/
data/*
!data/vumanchu_state_table.json
